ore he puts an end to the world.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/823610/extras/796bf3d69c5ccb0d17fe911381c12fe4.poster.avif?t=1667096217\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/823610/extras/796bf3d69c5ccb0d17fe911381c12fe4.webm?t=1667096217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/823610/extras/796bf3d69c5ccb0d17fe911381c12fe4.mp4?t=1667096217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Owner of the Dragonslayer tavern, Rula</h2>Once upon a time... I think you are quite familiar with this kind of legend. What I want to mention is that your client, Lula, is a mysterious and beautiful lady. During the exploration you can visit her tavern.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/823610/extras/13e173116ae6197e557da5569420707f.poster.avif?t=1667096217\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/823610/extras/13e173116ae6197e557da5569420707f.webm?t=1667096217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/823610/extras/13e173116ae6197e557da5569420707f.mp4?t=1667096217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >To survive the dungeon</h2><strong>Fire guides you:</strong><br>The most terrible nightmare in the dungeon is getting lost. To make the situation worse, fire is going out. You'll feel a growing sense of isolation and loneliness as you trek through the dark tunnels. Thanks to our designer, you have access to this exciting and life-like exploration in DODK.<br><strong>Speaking of spells:</strong><br>The magic system uses a series of six runes that can be combined with one another to create more complicated spells. They are not just on a list. You have to use trial and error to figure out what each combination does.<br><strong>Keep stones and carry on:</strong><br>Puzzle solving is another major feature of the game. You will face increasingly challenging puzzles during the exploration. As an ancient saying goes: &quot;Where there is a stone, there is a way.&quot; When confused, use your stone.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dungeon Tavern on discord</h2>Come and have a drink！<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/823610/extras/5f0522b0dfee4940d23c95a7fc308208.poster.avif?t=1667096217\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/823610/extras/5f0522b0dfee4940d23c95a7fc308208.webm?t=1667096217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/823610/extras/5f0522b0dfee4940d23c95a7fc308208.mp4?t=1667096217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
      "short_description": "Dungeon of Dragon Knight is a retro dungeon crawler RPG in modern visual design. Pointed by a mysterious witch, your party will descend into a dungeon with traps and monsters in search of the evil Dragon Knight and his treasure weapon. Or, are you fooled by the witch?",
